abstract: >-
  BdStomatrix is an automated computer-vision pipeline for stomatal detection,
  cell segmentation, morphometry, density estimation, and spatial row and band
  trait extraction from Brachypodium microscopy images.

keywords:
  - "Brachypodium"
  - "stomata"
  - "computer vision"
  - "image segmentation"
  - "plant phenotyping"
  - "spatial traits"

